sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as UI thread
    participant SG as scene_graph
    participant SB as snapshot_buffer
    participant RT as Render thread
    participant VK as Vulkan

    Note over UI: affinity = ui
    UI->>SG: update(dt), collect_damage
    UI->>SG: build_draw_list_into(write_draw_list)
    UI->>SG: commit_frame(frame_index)
    SG->>SB: publish(draws, damage, index)
    Note over SB: atomic swap write buffer

    Note over RT: affinity = render
    RT->>SG: acquire_render_snapshot()
    SG->>SB: acquire()
    SB-->>RT: immutable_frame_snapshot
    RT->>VK: record draws + present
    Note over RT,VK: snapshot is read-only; no UI mutation

    participant Worker as Worker thread
    Note over Worker: affinity = worker
    Worker->>Worker: layout / decode / shape
    Worker->>UI: executor.post(ui, apply_results)
    UI->>SG: apply layout results (UI only)
